      "comment": "BREUKELEN (5) kept improving throughout the first campaign. They tipped him out on a high and now returns off one trial. Can pick up where he left off. DENIAL (1) keeps running similar races each time. He does have some weight to carry but this is easier than the last couple. Can give this a shake. ENNIROC (2) has not raced since scoring over 1000m at Tamworth on August 25. Can take a run to get going but draws a lovely barrier to launch late. TO BE FRANK (7) puts himself into the leading fray most times. Can be placed with luck. THE LUPERCAL (6) was caught deep so made a dash forward before the turn then stuck on well to finish fourth last start over 1100m at Port Macquarie. Usually thereabouts and can feature.",
